==English==

===Etymology===
Latin [[animal#Latin|animal]] + the diminutive suffix [[-culum]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{dated}} A minute or microscopic animal or [[protozoan]].
# {{archaic}} A tiny animal, as a mouse or [[insect]] ([[fly]], [[mosquito]], [[midge]]).

====Synonyms====
* [[animalculum]]

====Hyponyms====
* [[rotifer]] or [[wheel animalcule]]
* [[paramecium]] or [[slipper animalcule]]
* [[stentor]] or [[trumpet animalcule]]
* [[peritrich]] or [[bell animalcule]]
* [[heliozoa]] or [[sun animalcule]]
* [[amoeba]] or [[proteus animalcule]]

